# Violin: double stops: notes held together are bowed together on adjacent
# strings. A moving line over a held open A, then sustained and short chords.
tempo 60
0 poly on
0 dyn 0.5
0 vib 0.5
0 on A4 70              # open A, held under the line on the E string
0 note E5 1.05 70
1 note F#5 1.05 70
2 note G#5 1.05 70
3 note A5 1.9 80
3 off A4
5 note D4 1.9 70        # a sixth: open D, B4 on the A string
5 note B4 1.9 70
7 note B3 1.9 70        # a third: B3 on the G string, open D
7 note D4 1.9 70
9 bow on
9 note D4 0.2 90        # short chords on the string: both notes in one stroke
9 note A4 0.2 90
9.5 note D4 0.2 90
9.5 note A4 0.2 90
10 note G3 0.2 90
10 note D4 0.2 90
